## Cross-Linking Strategy

Every site links to every other site in a coherent network:

- **worldof.world** (hub): Links to aguywithai, haimu, uniworld, grandbeta
- **aguywithai.world**: Links to worldof (personal hub), uniworld (project),
  haimu (methodology), podcast (Simplecast/embedded)
- **haimu.world**: Forwards to aguywithai.world/haimu, which links to aguywithai
  (developer), uniworld (case study), worldof (all projects)
- **uniworld.world**: Links to aguywithai (publisher), haimu (methodology),
  grandbeta (funding), worldof (all projects)

Footer on all sites should include:
```
Sean MacNutt | worldof.world | aguywithai.world | haimu.world | grandbeta.world
```

