## Style Guidelines (Pending Full Coding Rules)

- Plain HTML/CSS/vanilla JS. No frameworks.
- System font stack across all sites for consistency and script coverage
- Shared colour palette (dark navy, off-white, muted blue, warm orange -- from
  UniWorld's visual identity, adaptable per site)
- Mobile-responsive from the start
- No analytics, no cookies, no tracking
- Semantic HTML5 (header, main, section, footer, nav)
- Accessible: alt text, sufficient contrast, keyboard navigation

